desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Avoid V Html"
	title_zh: "检测到Avoid V Html",
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-avoid-v-html"
	risk: "xss"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Dynamically rendering arbitrary HTML on your website can be very dangerous because it can easily lead to XSS vulnerabilities. Only use HTML interpolation on trusted content and never on user-provided content.

### 风险类型
跨站脚本（XSS）（xss）

### 影响
未正确转义或过滤用户输入，攻击者可在页面中注入并执行恶意脚本。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-79: Improper Neutralization of Input During Web Page Generation ('Cross-site Scripting')
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
对输出进行上下文相关的转义，使用安全的模板 API，并启用 CSP 等防护。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.vue": <<<POS
<_n57bE&8v-html=

POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${*.vue}.pattern_regex(/<[^<>]*v-html=/) as $p0
$p0 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Avoid V Html",
	title_zh: "检测到Avoid V Html",
	message: "Avoid V Html",
}
